WEBVTT

00:08:28.145 --> 00:08:32.899
A car is a similar object,
and they can get in a car and drive it.

00:08:32.923 --> 00:08:37.268
And that really gives them
a handle on a world

00:08:37.292 --> 00:08:41.841
in a way that they don't often
have access to.

00:08:41.865 --> 00:08:43.495
And it's perfectly legal.

00:08:43.519 --> 00:08:46.169
Find a big empty lot,
make sure there's nothing in it,

00:08:46.193 --> 00:08:49.976
and that it's on private property,
and let them drive your car.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.609
It's very safe actually.

00:08:51.633 --> 00:08:53.602
And it's fun for the whole family.

00:08:53.626 --> 00:08:57.246
(Laughter)

00:08:57.984 --> 00:09:01.000
Let's see, I think that's it.
That's number five and a half. OK.